  <History Date="07-12-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest charts (adds 'no barndoor' modes, changed Barndoor Rot to a single index range, adds fade range to CTC xFade and removes barndoor control functions/macros)" Version="1" />
